'Vancomycin and aminoglycosides are nephrotoxic and ototoxic; co-administration potentiates renal tubular and auditory injury, a well-documented risk particularly in critically ill patients or those with renal impairment.',
'Evitar quando possível; se a associação for clinicamente necessária, minimizar a duração, garantir hidratação e ajustar doses à função renal.',
'Avoid when possible; if clinically necessary, minimize duration, ensure hydration and adjust doses to renal function.',
